{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"撒迦利亚书","commonName":"撒迦利亚书","title":"撒迦利亚书","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"8cf62f43a8ce797cc4cdd63e937097d1b0225901663353bd7ce9b6f60df7db51","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":11,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["羊群必遭杀戮"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["黎巴嫩啊，打开你的门吧，",{"text":"好让火焰吞噬你的香柏树。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"松树啊，哀号吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为香柏树已经倒下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挺拔的树木已被毁坏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴珊的橡树啊，哀号吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为茂密的树林已被砍倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"听啊，牧人在哀号，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们肥美的草场已被毁坏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"听啊，狮子在吼叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为约旦河畔的丛林已被毁坏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我的上帝耶和华说：“你去牧养这群待宰的羊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["买羊的宰羊却不受惩罚，卖羊的说，‘耶和华当受称颂！我发财了。’它们的牧人毫不怜悯它们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我不再怜悯这地方的居民，我要使他们落在邻人及其君王手中，任这地方被摧毁，必不从敌人手中拯救他们。这是耶和华说的。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["于是，我牧养这群最困苦的待宰之羊。我拿了两根杖，一根叫“恩惠”，一根叫“联合”，开始牧养这群羊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我在一个月之内除掉了三个牧人。 我厌烦羊群，他们也厌恶我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["于是我说：“我不再牧养你们了。要死的就死吧，要亡的就亡吧，让剩下的互相吞吃吧。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["然后，我拿起那根叫“恩惠”的杖，把它折断，以废除我与万民所立的约。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["约就在当天废除了，那些注视着我的困苦羊便知道这是上帝的话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我对他们说：“你们若认为好，就给我工钱，不然就算了。”于是，他们给了我三十块银子作工钱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["耶和华对我说：“把这一大笔钱丢给窑户吧，这就是我在他们眼中的价值！”我便把三十块银子丢给圣殿中的窑户。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我又把那根叫“联合”的杖折断，以断开犹大和以色列之间的手足之情。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["耶和华又对我说：“你再拿起愚昧牧人的器具，"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["因为我要使一位牧人在地上兴起，他不照顾丧亡的，不寻找失散的，不医治受伤的，不牧养健壮的，反而吃肥羊的肉，撕掉它们的蹄子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"“丢弃羊群的无用牧人有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿刀砍在他的臂膀和右眼上！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿他的臂膀彻底枯槁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的右眼完全失明！”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/11.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/12.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}